{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_elysm_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_elysm_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "漫长旅途",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_elysm_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "688230ffcb3776990a40481d1aeebac18e05228a0bcb6caa6a3a40a94d67c175",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "老板，你的信我放在这了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "下午我要去城里一趟，如果有什么要代购的东西，可以在我出发前写在这张购物单上，过期不候，大家注意啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，这么快回信就到了！多谢你了，极境小哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你又要去城里了？还是为了你那台什么发......发信器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "正式名称是信号发射接收一体器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "虽然是二手的，发信范围不算很大，但你看这机箱，这涂装配色，不觉得和我的穿搭配起来刚刚好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我可搞不懂你那什么时尚品味......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小伙子，也帮我带点城里的烟草，就和上次的一样就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我还想要一个城里最近流行的卷发棒，能拜托你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "好说好说，是要最新款的那个卷发棒对吧，我记下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂小伙子，还有我的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "嗯？上次是谁让我带烟草，结果转头就被家人发现，零用钱都被没收了？我可是都记着呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "按我的记忆力来看，再过个大约四五十年，应该就能把上次的事情忘掉了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你这也记太久了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啧，现在的年轻人真是管得宽又啰嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你别理他！医生都说他不能再这么抽烟了，还是不听劝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来，这是买卷发棒的钱，那就拜托你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "放心，保证给你挑个款式最好看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "那我就出发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这已经是离开家乡的第几个年头？\n第三年？不对，第三年他身在哥伦比亚，之后又继续向北边走，到了萨米。\n要再往北时，被那些居住在冰天雪地中的雪祀拦下了，于是他只好转变方向，继续旅途。\n一个健康的成年人，还会点源石技艺，不太挑剔的话，日子就不会很难过。\n如果旅费告罄，就在当地找份工作，攒够了钱再出发。一路走走停停，极境如愿看过种种风景。\n有些地方富庶繁华，也有地方贫瘠蛮荒。\n在这座小镇停下，倒也不是因为这里有什么特别之处。\n只是走了这么久，想要找个地方歇歇脚而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "最新款的卷发棒，还有......嗯，这么一小包烟草应该还不至于影响健康，没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "发信器还差最后一个配件，这种增幅器真有点不太好找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......是错觉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "总觉得这天有点不太对劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这天气......看起来有点不对劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "哦，兄弟你也这么觉得？这就叫英雄所见略同吧，我也觉得有点怪怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "看你这打扮，应该不是寻常人士吧？说你刚打劫这家店还没来得及逃跑估计都有人信，不管你卖的是什么，我猜今天都没卖出去多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不劳你操心。我们本来也不是单纯的店铺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "咦，但你们这不是有商品吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是准备要推广的预防药剂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "预防药剂？真有这么厉害，该不会是预防矿石病的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "据说真正有效果的预防药贵得吓人，除了那些有钱人，真正需要用的人基本上都用不起，市面上的那些药大多都没什么效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "哎，但我看人还蛮准的，我觉得你们不像是卖假货的，难不成是真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "你能听见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "你话真多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "请称这为热情。热情可是与人友好相处的良方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "特别是和两位这样看起来就挺危险的人物交流，万一我现在其实看到了什么不该看的，比如来历不明的预防药什么的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "至少一会你们决定揍我的时候下手会轻一点吧，至少那边那个蒙着脸的小哥应该会心软的，我能确定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不我不会。我会对着你的脸揍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "诚实点，别害羞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "不过现在，我觉得你们不太像什么假药团伙或者走私团伙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "本来就不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我们是......制药公司。负责解决感染者问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "是解决感染者，还是解决问题？——换个人我可能就这么问了，不过我觉得你们应该可信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你真的最好小心点，你长嘴就是为了被揍的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "暴力可不好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "好了，耽搁了这么久，我也该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "兄弟，我看你和这边这位都不适合当前台，记得换个人啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快走吧你，要你多管闲事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "接着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "哇哇哇！怎么忽然暗器伤人......嗯？这是，预防药？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "是要送给我？这多不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沉默的女士”",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "三塔勒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "结果还是要收钱？！虽然是不贵啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "队长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "刚刚那个人，应该不是在自言自语吧？难道他是在和队长您说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是队长您......这不可能啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不好意思啊，这位客人，你要的这款增幅器我们这没货了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "不是吧老板，你这是我最后的希望了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "真的没有了？在仓库的角落里放太久一时没找到什么的......有没有这种可能性？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能找的地方我都替你找过了，而且我们进货卖货都是有记录的，白纸黑字，错不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我知道，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看你这也不是第一次来了，这次还是为了上回说想要修的那台机器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "没错！看我的信号发射接收一体器！这些改装都是我亲手完成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "虽然之前都没怎么接触过这方面的知识，但是一边自学一边改装意外的顺利，哎呀，就连我本人也有点被自己的学习能力吓到了呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "只要能找到合适的增幅器，它的性能就能够再拔高一个档次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "老板，你看我去做个信使怎么样？正好我的源石技艺也挺合适的，我这样的人才浪费了可惜啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，信使可不是拼台发信器就能当的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "还要考试对吧？不瞒你说，老板，我以前在家乡的时候可是人称学界突击四天王之一......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等会，这什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "就是特别擅长应付考试的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "行了，别贫了，说正经的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你要的这型号平时用的不多，不过你要是能再等一阵子，我可以帮你试试看能不能搞到货。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "完全没问题，我最近一段时间都会留在附近的镇子里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "那就这么说定了，隔段时间我再来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电台广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——紧急通知，紧急通知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电台广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "下面为广大市民插播一条实时速报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看得这么认真，老板，是谁的信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别吵，别打扰我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "太好了！成了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？什么成了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼，八成是和极境那个小伙子有关，我看信封上的署名，像是之前那个调去大城市的什么信使老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是天灾信使老爷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "极境小哥来我们镇上时间也不短了，我想着也不能让他总是租我们的小房间住，租房的开销也不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以我就写信去问了问，天灾信使老爷回信说，同意让极境小哥搬进他那栋房子里住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......他能有这么好心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们在说什么，什么天灾信使老爷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们镇不是一直没有信使来着？我记得极境他上次还说，搞不好他会成为小镇的常驻信使啥的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这个......其实，之前我们还是有过一位天灾信使老爷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "镇上当初希望能把人留下，还特地分了房子给天灾信使老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但那些老爷们哪会愿意在咱们这种小地方待着，没留多久，人就走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想起来就满肚子气，不说了，我先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也怪不了别人，大城市能开出来的酬金，比我们这种偏远小镇要高得多，人家要走，谁都拦不住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没事，要走就走吧，我们还不稀罕呢！而且，现在不是有极境那小子嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他都提前给自己起什么工作代号了，还非说专业信使的第一步就是从起一个帅气的代号开始，应该不是开玩笑的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，但愿是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等一下，你有没有感觉，好像有点不对劲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂！不好了！快出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "外面、外面的天变了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "西南方向不是我进货要走的地区，应该不用太在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不会影响小哥你要的货......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "老板，我先把买增幅器要用的钱放这了！一定要记得帮我进货，我会来取的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂等等？！小哥，你跑什么啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "不跑不行，这次可是名副其实的和天灾赛跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "现在返回，意味着巨大的风险。\n极境忍不住问自己：他和那座小镇的感情有深厚到这种地步吗？\n难说。他心想，其实还不至于，哪就到愿意冒生命危险这么夸张的地步了，只是个住了几个月的小镇罢了。\n只是他同时也清楚，要就这么站在旁边看着，等一切风平浪静之后再采取行动，这事自己绝对做不到。\n既然如此，那就干脆别想那些做不到的事了。\n现在更应该集中精神，好好想想有哪些是他能做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "妈妈，天上怎么有那么大一片云，我害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无措的母亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别、别怕，我们现在就去找你爸爸，别怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌乱的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "刚刚那是地震？！我们现在该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的男性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谁能帮我把这块板子移开，这东西忽然砸下来，我的腿，我的腿动不了了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等着！我这就来帮忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么回事，这到底是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "天灾，是天灾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "上一回也是这样！快逃，必须得立刻离开，走得越远越好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "真是一场完美的英雄救美，如果我做评委，刚刚那个转身的动作我一定会给十分满分，你们觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "极境小哥......！你、你受伤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你怎么在这，你不是去城里了吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "别担心，小伤而已，没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "冥冥之中，我察觉到有人需要我的帮助——好吧，我收到这边可能被天灾波及的消息，就赶回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "怎么样，是不是很够义气？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你、你、你这个傻货！呆鸟！谁要你这种时候回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "等会，怎么还骂起人来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "玩笑到此为止，现在不是说这些的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "麻烦几位尽量通知镇上的所有人，现在立刻准备转移......这样的突发性天灾势头太猛，再不避难就真的来不及了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是我们要去哪里避难？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "如果各位相信我的话，就交给我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我可是野外生存专家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "大家跟紧我！注意不要走散了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "天灾环境下空气中的源石浓度会急剧升高，强风中也可能带有一些活性颗粒，大家注意尽量不要裸露皮肤，不要让身上有任何伤口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那，刚刚你的伤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "别担心，我有秘密武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（之前那支药剂居然真的要派上用场了，这谁想得到啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（但愿他们卖的真的不是假药。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "大家再坚持一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "目的地......就在这前面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "把上面的这扇门封紧......好了，这样应该暂时安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里是地下避难所？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "没错，是已经被废弃了的避难设施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我从来没听说过还有这么个地方，你居然能找到这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "不是我自夸，论认路没多少人能比得上我，为了绘制这附近的地图，我可是把周边的荒野全都用脚丈量了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "可以说，这里没有我不认识的地方，就算是寻找多年前已废弃的避难所也不在话下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我的意思是，你们现在可以多夸夸我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？呃......太帅了，极境小哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "对对，就是这种大实话就可以了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳，确、确实要多谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那现在我们就在这里等着就行了？大家走得急，都没带什么东西......我们要在这里待多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "至少要等天灾过去，外面的环境恢复正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "放心，一般来说这种突发性的天灾来得快去得也快，不会持续太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......如果不是你回来了，真难想象我们现在会是什么状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "小事，别客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "不过这次之后，镇上还是得想点办法应对之后可能有的危险情况才行，这座避难设施各处都老化了，老实说安全系数不高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "如果这次天灾伴有从地层向上生长的晶簇现象，我怎么也不会选择这里，好在没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈......看起来我们拿天灾毫无办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果能提前得知消息的话，至少还有时间准备......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "别太悲观了，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我不就是在为了解决这个问题做准备？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这真是个好消息。对了，你从刚刚起就在捣鼓什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "只是调试一些机器而已，你可以想象成我在试着对方圆几公里之内大喊“这里有人，需要支援”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "虽然现在用不上，但是有备无患嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "地面在晃，好可怕，到底还要持续多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "噫！刚刚那是什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好像有什么东西砸下来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黎博利穿过人群，在这间缺少照明的避难所中，挤满了小镇的镇民。\n孩子歪着头，被六神无主的母亲紧紧搂在怀中，老人们坐在角落，蜷背躬身，像是一尊尊布满褶皱的雕塑。\n时不时响起一两声压抑的抽泣，在这里的人数似乎比他记忆中的要少，极境不敢去想这件事。\n他看向巨响传来的方向，上方是他们进入避难所的那扇门，陈旧的灰土随着震动不断窸窸窣窣地落下，落在极境的脸上。\n这让他忽然生出一种不好的预感。\n黎博利伸出手，片刻之后，他忽然愣在原地。\n随着检查，极境忽然意识到一件事——\n那扇通向外界的门，被坍塌的岩石封死，怎么也推不开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "出不去了？！怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "慌什么！不就是被塌下来的东西压住了吗，到时候我们一起挖出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "大家先别急，别忘了我还有这台发信器，刚刚我已经成功把求救信号发送出去了，现在我们只要等待就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的吗？太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（话是这么说，但没有增幅器，能够发信的范围相当有限......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（得想点办法。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（还没来得及用药，刚刚受伤的胳膊，有点失去知觉了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（刚才一直在源石粉尘环境里活动，虽然裹上了衣物，但是这种隔离的效果太差了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（不会这么倒霉吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（不过，如果是在这个情况下，搞不好也算是一种幸运......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "外面好像安静下来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "好消息，看来天灾已经过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还没有消息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "暂时还没有，不过有个好消息，经过本人的努力，我们的发信范围有所突破！再加上天灾已经结束，或许很快就会有救援了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但愿如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "极境小哥，你的伤看起来变严重了，你说的秘密武器呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "呃......这个嘛，现在还不是用的时候啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "放心放心，有必要的话我会用的，有必要的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "见鬼了，这上面是压了多少层沙土，根本挖不穿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "吃的喝的都没有，不能再这么下去了！外面还没有消息吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "你先别急，既然这条路走不通，那还是多保存体力吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我没法不着急！你的信号都发了多久了？根本没有任何回音吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没人会来救我们！这样下去，我们所有人都会在这里饿死，闷死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我有个办法，如果能联系上邻近的移动城市，可能会有人来救援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但这破机器的发信范围根本不可能有那么远！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "是啊，所以这里就要用上本帅哥的独家秘法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "但是有一件事一定要注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "从现在开始，让大家都离我远点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "离你远点？你这是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "就是......嗯，字面意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "给我一块单独的空间。不要靠得太近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是......第几天了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我、不行......我有点撑不住了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "再等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还要等到什么时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "发信范围正在扩大，撑住，我已经有把握了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没救了，大家都没救了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年长的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "留在上面的，和下来的，大家都完了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "别说，咳，这种丧气话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（再快点，事到如今了......再快点！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（负责解决感染者问题的制药公司，你们可千万不能让我看走眼啊！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "咳、咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（伤口肿胀，应该还有些溃烂。全身都有同感，很像上次被雷姆必拓的车床从身上碾过去的感觉......不对，还是上次更痛。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（源石技艺在不断增强......虽然使用的同时会引发阵痛。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（这就是感染矿石病的感觉？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "（难得拿到的预防药，可惜用不上了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么............声音............"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "有回音了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......回音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "对！回音！有一个基站，捕捉到了我的信号......并且给了回复！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "大家都听到了吗？再撑一撑，有人来救援了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是这里没错吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真不知道那个信号是怎么这么准确地找上我们的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙面怪人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "罗德岛竟然这么有名了吗？我们这才活动多久啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "队长，确认下方有大量生命反应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "准备完毕，随时可以进行救援！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欢迎......啊，是你啊，极境小哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "早上好啊各位，有一段时间没见了吧，这里看起来已经重建好了，真不错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，嗯......托你的福，我们都没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "那太好了，不枉我这么努力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是简单先搭个能遮风避雨的屋子，这点活不算难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你这段时间去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我？我被一群看起来不太像好人的好人拉去治病去了，这次被骂惨了呢，我从来不知道医生能这么凶，吓死人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "总之你先坐，我、我去给你倒杯饮料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "哎等一下，不用这么麻烦了，我就说两句话就走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我打算要离开了，这次是来和各位辞行的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你、你要走了？但你不是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "啊，如果是说留下来当信使那事，不好意思了，就当我毁约吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "抱歉啊，看来我还是更想出去看看不一样的风景，自由的羽翼不该被束缚......怎么样，我从你藏着的那本诗集上看来的，是不是很帅气？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不行，极境小哥，我、我们还没感谢你救了我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "确实。不就是得病，这也......也没什么大不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你是因为感染，所以才要走的话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "嘘，好了，大家的心意我收到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "但是镇上要是住了一个感染者，大家会吓得不敢说话的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们不会怕你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "我知道，我知道，但这事总归是有风险的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "别这副表情嘛，其实这也是件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "罗德岛，你们还记得吗？就是来救援我们的那个公司，我这次就是和他们一起走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "他们还说能给我提供长期治疗，这么好的事到哪找！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他们能治得好你的病吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "这个......不好说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小店老板",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那、那你还会再回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "放心，有空我一定回来探望各位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你接下来，准备去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "这个嘛，其实我也还不确定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "暂且跟着罗德岛的人走一段路吧，感觉好像会是很不错的旅途。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "aliases": [
        "“沉默的女士”",
        "极境"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
